OL,3,ATeenage boy guilty of trying to murder
OL,4,Agirl, 15, in school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA masked teenager who was captured on
OL,7,FCCTV stabbing a girl at his school has
OL,8,Fbeen found guilty of attempted murder.
OL,10,FArmed police were called to Thorpe St
OL,11,FAndrew School, near Norwich, on
OL,12,FWednesday 11 March following reports a
OL,13,F15-year-old had been stabbed in the
OL,14,Fback.
OL,16,FHer attacker brought a knife to school,
OL,17,Fwas dressed in black, was wearing a
OL,18,Fface mask and had written notes saying
OL,19,Fhe hated women, the trial at King's
OL,20,FLynn Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
